/* ==========================================================================
   GHOST DATA STILL EXISTS — CYBER FORENSICS UI DESIGN SYSTEM
   Theme: Deep Obsidian & Cyber Cyan / Emerald / Crimson
   Fonts: Outfit (Headings), Inter (UI), JetBrains Mono (Forensic Traces)
